# Coldline
# File: .gitignore
# Component: Repository hygiene
# Purpose: Exclude local tools, caches, and runtime state from commits.
# Interacts With: Git and local development tools
# Sprint/Task: Sprint 2 — Project 2
# Concepts: Clean working tree
# Tools: Git

.env
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tools/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The two retained benchmark reports are required run artifacts, not scratch
# output: the assessed checks grade the recorded answers against them, and the
# CMS assessment needs them too. So they are committed, and only the rest
# of the directory is ignored. They are generated - the harness writes them and
# nothing else should - which is why they are listed separately from the
# student-editable paths in docs/student/task-2-7-contract.md.
.benchmark/*
!.benchmark/baseline.json
!.benchmark/experiment.json
